And all that I can see

And all that I can see (ah, dip, dip, dip)
And all that I can see
Is just a yellow lemon tree', '"[00:13.22]I''m sitting here in the boring room\\n[00:17.32]It''s just another rainy Sunday afternoon\\n[00:20.43]I''m wasting my time, I got nothing to do\\n[00:23.78]I''m hanging around, I''m waiting for you\\n[00:26.73]But nothing ever happens, and I wonder\\n[00:33.70]I''m driving around in my car\\n[00:37.02]I''m driving too fast, I''m driving too far\\n[00:40.43]I''d like to change my point of view\\n[00:43.78]I feel so lonely, I''m waiting for you\\n[00:46.87]But nothing ever happens, and I wonder\\n[00:50.98]\\n[00:53.55]I wonder how\\n[00:55.49]I wonder why\\n[00:57.13]Yesterday you told me ''bout the blue, blue sky\\n[01:00.27]And all that I can see is just another lemon tree\\n[01:07.06]I''m turning my head up and down\\n[01:10.65]I''m turning, turning, turning, turning, turning around\\n[01:13.93]And all that I can see is just another lemon tree\\n[01:19.36]Sing!\\n[01:20.25]Dap-dadada-dadpm-didap-da\\n[01:25.41]Dadada-dadpm-didap-da\\n[01:28.69]Dap-didili-da\\n[01:33.24]I''m sitting here, I miss the power\\n[01:36.79]I''d like to go out, taking a shower\\n[01:40.03]But there''s a heavy cloud inside my head\\n[01:43.30]I feel so tired, put myself into bed\\n[01:46.15]Well, nothing ever happens, and I wonder\\n[01:53.33]Isolation is not good for me\\n[02:00.37]Isolation, well, I don''t want to sit on the lemon tree\\n[02:06.32]I''m steppin'' around in the desert of joy\\n[02:09.32]Baby, anyhow I''ll get another toy\\n[02:12.36]And everything will happen, and you wonder\\n[02:19.40]I wonder how\\n[02:20.63]I wonder why\\n[02:22.56]Yesterday you told me ''bout the blue, blue sky\\n[02:25.64]And all that I can see is just another lemon tree\\n[02:32.32]I''m turning my head up and down\\n[02:35.69]I''m turning, turning, turning, turning, turning around\\n[02:38.73]And all that I can see is just another lemon tree\\n[02:43.64]And I wonder, wonder\\n[02:45.56]I wonder how\\n[02:47.16]I wonder why\\n[02:48.64]Yesterday you told me 